[ti:A Pleasant Dream]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.80]Lesson 137 | 第137课
[00:03.75]A pleasant dream | 一个美梦
[00:06.45]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.66]What would Julie like to do, if she had the money? | 如果朱莉有钱,她想做什么?
[00:18.93]Are you doing the football pools, Brain? | 布莱恩,你在填足球彩票吗?
[00:23.55]Yes, I've nearly finished, Julie. | 是的,我快填完了,朱莉。
[00:26.80]I'm sure we'll win something this week. | 我肯定这周我们会中奖的。
[00:30.57]You always say that, but we never win anything! | 你总是这么说,但我们从来没有中过奖!
[00:36.85]What will you do if you win a lot of money? | 如果你中了很多钱,你会做什么?
[00:41.72]If I win a lot of money I'll buy you a mink coat. | 如果我中了很多钱,我会给你买一件貂皮大衣。
[00:48.11]I don't want a mink coat! | 我不想要貂皮大衣!
[00:51.09]I want to see the world. | 我想去看看世界。
[00:54.83]All right. | 好吧。
[00:56.54]If we win a lot of money we'll travel round the world and we'll stay at the best hotels. | 如果我们中了很多钱,我们将环游世界,住在最好的酒店。
[01:05.43]Then we'll return home and buy a big house in the country. | 然后我们会回家,在乡下买一幢大房子。
[01:11.97]We'll have a beautiful garden and... | 我们会有一个漂亮的花园,然后……
[01:15.85]But if we spend all that money we'll be poor again. | 但如果我们把所有钱都花光了,我们又会变穷。
[01:21.79]What'll we do then? | 那我们该怎么办?
[01:25.30]If we spend all the money we'll try and win the football pools again. | 如果我们把钱都花光了,我们就再试着中足球彩票。
[01:32.33]It's a pleasant dream but everything depends on 'if' ! | 这是一个美梦,但一切都取决于'如果'!